Custom i3 keybindings cheat sheet:

--> to update this run the following command:
wget --backups=1 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/endeavouros-team/endeavouros-i3wm-setup/main/.config/i3/keybindings -P ~/.config/i3/

All sources and updates are available at GitHub:
https://github.com/endeavouros-team/endeavouros-i3wm-setup

For reference consult our WIKI:
https://discovery.endeavouros.com/window-tiling-managers/i3-wm/

 = windows key

# start wezterm
+Return

# kill focused window
+q

# Application menu search by typing (fancy Rofi menu):
+Space

# Window switcher menu (fancy Rofi menu):
+t

# fancy exit-menu on bottom right:
+Shift+e

# Lock the system
# lock with a picture or blurring the screen (options in config)
+l

# reload the configuration file
+Shift+c

# restart i3 inplace (preserves your layout/session, can be used to upgrade i3)
+Shift+r

# change window focus
+Left focus left
+Down focus down
+Up focus up
+Right focus right

# move a focused window
+Shift+Left move left
+Shift+Down move down
+Shift+Up move up
+Shift+Right move right

# split in horizontal orientation
Ctrl+.

# stack layout
Ctrl+,

# enter fullscreen mode for the focused container
+Shift+Space fullscreen toggle

# floating toggle
+Alt+f

# switch focus between tiling and floating
+Shift+f

# split+move toward direction
+Alt+Left
+Alt+Down
+Alt+Up
+Alt+Right

# next/prev workspace
+Ctrl+Right
+Ctrl+Left

# focus output
+Ctrl+Up
+Ctrl+Down

# focus main monitor
+Alt+m

# resize width
+Shift+-
+Shift+=

# workspaces
F1..F9 go to workspace
Shift+F1..Shift+F9 move window to workspace

# service mode
Ctrl+Escape

## Multimedia Keys

# Redirect sound to headphones
+p

## App shortcuts
+d starts Godot Mono on ws9
+b starts Firefox
+g starts GitHub in Firefox on ws4
+f starts Yazi in WezTerm
+y starts YouTube in Firefox
 +Shift+y starts YouTube Music in Firefox
